70
00:04:40.636 --> 00:04:45.545
Run node controller.js --all and compare
its five lines byte-for-byte

71
00:04:45.545 --> 00:04:50.455
with expected-summary.txt. The cases must
map to COMPLETE, NEEDS_HUMAN,

72
00:04:50.455 --> 00:04:55.364
BUDGET_EXHAUSTED, POLICY_BLOCKED, and
FAILED_WITH_RECOVERY_EVIDENCE. Run node

73
00:04:55.364 --> 00:05:00.273
controller.js --scenario success --trace
and compare the JSON with

74
00:05:00.273 --> 00:05:05.182
worked-trace.json. Confirm revision one
before the write, revision two after,

75
00:05:05.182 --> 00:05:10.091
one action charge, one ledger record, one
receipt, no approval

76
00:05:10.091 --> 00:05:15.000
requirement, and verifier acceptance.

77
00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:20.625
Run node controller.js --input
practice.json. The expected line is:

78
00:05:20.625 --> 00:05:26.250
practice: POLICY_BLOCKED | action
write_receipt is not allowed by trusted

79
00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:31.875
policy | effects=0. Copy practice.json to
my-practice.json. Add write_receipt to

80
00:05:31.875 --> 00:05:37.500
policy.allowedActions and change
limits.maxActions from zero to one. Keep

81
00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:43.125
the existing trusted approval unchanged.
Do not add approvedByHuman. Run

82
00:05:43.125 --> 00:05:48.750
node controller.js --input
my-practice.json. The expected line is:

83
00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:54.375
practice: COMPLETE | independent verifier
