132
00:31:14.000 --> 00:31:18.000
Begin the knowledge check when you can
explain the fixed-workflow

133
00:31:18.000 --> 00:31:22.000
alternative, approval binding, stale
revision block, action-invocation budget,

134
00:31:22.000 --> 00:31:26.000
no-progress threshold, independent
verifier, and recovery record. Review the

135
00:31:26.000 --> 00:31:30.000
class or return to the activity before
